AgentRealm runs alongside, but does not redistribute, the following third-party components. They
are pulled as container images or installed as dependencies at run time, under their own licenses:

  * Conduit (Matrix homeserver)   — Apache-2.0
  * LiteLLM (model proxy)         — MIT
  * PostgreSQL                    — PostgreSQL License
  * Hermes Agent (agent runtime)  — see its own repository

Python dependencies and their licenses are declared in pyproject.toml and pinned in uv.lock.
